WEBVTT

00:04:00.236 --> 00:04:03.316
Of course, they know
where things are in the forest:

00:04:03.836 --> 00:04:06.316
where the water and the waterfall [are],

00:04:06.356 --> 00:04:09.156
where the orchid is
and where the bear sleeps.

00:04:09.556 --> 00:04:13.916
But putting this knowledge on paper
is something else.

00:04:14.316 --> 00:04:16.756
Climbing up into the forest with her crew,

00:04:16.796 --> 00:04:18.836
they learn to read the GPS,

00:04:18.876 --> 00:04:20.556
orient around a map

00:04:20.596 --> 00:04:23.116
and take note of important
flora and fauna

00:04:23.156 --> 00:04:25.236
as well as signs of wildlife.

00:04:25.276 --> 00:04:29.316
They begin to plant trees
and restore parts that were degraded.

00:04:29.756 --> 00:04:31.796
Up to this day, In Indonesia,